        "tab-description": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Description",
            "content": "<p><strong>Your phone, on your car's screen — wirelessly, and without the lag.</strong></p><p>The AutoLinkr Lite™ turns your car's wired CarPlay or Android Auto into a fully wireless connection, then goes one step further: it mirrors your <em>entire</em> phone screen to your dash. Maps, music, your favorite apps — and video for your passengers when you're parked — all on the bigger display, no cable in sight.</p><p>Plug it into your car's USB port once. It pairs in seconds and reconnects automatically every time you start the engine — no app, no menus, no fuss. Dual-band 5.8GHz Wi-Fi keeps the picture smooth and the connection locked in, so you get the one thing the cheap dongles can't deliver: mirroring that doesn't stutter and a link that doesn't drop.</p><p>Whether it's the daily commute or a weekend road trip, the Lite makes your car feel years newer — for a fraction of the price of a new head unit. The smart, simple way to go wireless.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-compatibility": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Compatibility",
            "content": "<p>Works with virtually any vehicle that has <strong>factory wired Apple CarPlay or Android Auto</strong>, and with aftermarket head units that support it.</p><p>Compatible with hundreds of models from Toyota, Honda, Ford, Chevrolet, Nissan, Hyundai, Kia, VW, BMW, Mercedes and more. Includes both <strong>USB-A and USB-C</strong> adapters, so it fits virtually any port.</p><p><strong>Not compatible with:</strong> vehicles that have no built-in CarPlay/Android Auto at all (no factory or aftermarket head-unit support).</p><p><a href=\"/pages/supported-cars\">Check Your Car →</a><br/>Not sure? Contact us and we'll confirm in minutes.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-included": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>✔ AutoLinkr Lite™ wireless adapter</li><li>✔ USB-C connector (attached)</li><li>✔ USB-A adapter</li><li>✔ Quick-start guide</li><li>✔ Backed by the AutoLinkr warranty</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
