            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Shipping",
            "content": "<p>Ships within 24 hours from our US warehouse. Standard delivery 3–7 business days. <strong>Free shipping on 2-packs.</strong> Tracking sent the moment it ships.</p>",
            "page": "",
