            "heading": "Safety Disclaimer",
            "content": "<p>⚠️ Drive responsibly. Video and full-screen mirroring features are intended for use by passengers or while the vehicle is <strong>safely parked</strong>. Never watch video content while driving. Always follow your local distracted-driving laws. AutoLinkr is not affiliated with Apple or Google; \"CarPlay\" and \"Android Auto\" are trademarks of their respective owners.</p>",
