    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will the screen mirroring lag or fall out of sync like the cheap ones?",
            "text": "<p>No — that's the whole point of the Lite. Its dual-band 5.8GHz Wi-Fi is built for a smooth, low-latency picture so mirroring stays in sync. If it ever doesn't perform in your car, you're covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it keep disconnecting?",
            "text": "<p>The Lite is engineered for a stable, auto-reconnecting link — no dropout loops. It re-pairs automatically every time you start the car.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will this work with my car?",
            "text": "<p>If your car shows Apple CarPlay or Android Auto when you plug your phone in with a cable, the Lite makes it wireless. It works with hundreds of models — and if you're unsure, <a href=\"/pages/supported-cars\">check compatibility</a> or message us and we'll confirm in minutes.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it work with both iPhone and Android?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Wireless CarPlay for iPhone, wireless Android Auto for Android — plus screen mirroring on both.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it still work after an iOS or Android update?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Lite is designed to keep working through phone and OS updates, and we keep its firmware current.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this just a rebadged $29 dongle?",
            "text": "<p>No. It's an AutoLinkr product — tuned for reliable mirroring and connection, backed by our warranty, real support, and a brand 50,000+ drivers already trust. That's what the $29 no-names can't stand behind.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need Wi-Fi or a data plan for it to work?",
            "text": "<p>No separate Wi-Fi needed — it creates its own direct link to your car. Streaming or mapping apps use your phone's data as they normally would.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I watch video while the car is moving?",
            "text": "<p>Video and full mirroring are for passengers or when you're safely parked. Please never watch video while driving — follow your local laws.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
